<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0641_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Buena</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, is this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nIf you ever in my area, don’t be\fshy, OK? Pull up and talk to me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, is this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nIf you ever in my area, don’t be\fshy, OK? Pull up and talk to me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Buena...\rOh! Mornin’, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nI’m kinda foggy in the mornin’...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Buena...\rOh! Mornin’, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nI’m kinda foggy in the mornin’...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Buena...\rOh! Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou be tunin’ into Buena’s show?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Buena...\rOh! Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou be tunin’ into Buena’s show?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Buena...\nOh! Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI just got off work.\nLemme tell you, I’m DEAD tired!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Buena...\nOh! Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI just got off work.\nLemme tell you, I’m DEAD tired!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi...\nThis Buena.\rI can’t come to the phone right now.\rIf you wanna chat, tune into Buena’s\nPassword on the radio and hit\fme up after midnight!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m thinkin’ ’bout hittin’ the Game\nCorner tomorrow. It been a minute.\rYou know, I got this FIRE strategy\nfor playin’...\fI always eat!\rHuh? Nuh-uh, it’s my secret!\nYou gotta figure it out yourself!\rCatch you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You use your Pokégear\nto listen to the radio, right?\rI heard you can even pull up town\nmaps with the Pokégear.\rI got NO sense of direction, so\nthe Pokégear would be clutch...\rAnyway, good looks for callin’! Later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Is it sunny outside today?\rWhen you cooped up in the Radio\nTower as much as me, you lose touch\fwith the outside.\rIt get borin’. Call again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh. Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou how?\rAiyee! This ain’t the time for me\nto be crackin’ silly jokes!\rThe Feds done RAIDED the Radio Tower!\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you better watch yourself!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh. Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou how?\rAiyee! This ain’t the time for me\nto be crackin’ silly jokes!\rThe Feds done RAIDED the Radio Tower!\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you better watch yourself!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ayo, it’s Buena!\nI got up early, so I called!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ayo, it’s Buena!\nI got up early, so I called!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ayo, it’s Buena!\nI needed somebody to chat with!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ayo, it’s Buena!\nI needed somebody to chat with!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ayo, it’s Buena!\nI couldn’t sleep, so I called you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Ayo, it’s Buena!\nI couldn’t sleep, so I called you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The other day, I went out to eat with\nDJ Ben! Ain’t that great?\rNot only that, he said the music on\nmy show go HARD!\rOh, sheesh! Like, what do I do?\r...Oops, I gotta get ready for my\nshow! Catch you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know the receptionist at the\nRadio Tower?\r“Welcome” is all she ever say.\rBut she deadass the biggest gossip\nin the whole Radio Tower.\rSo she must be holdin’ back.\nAin’t that juicy?\rCatch you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You won the Homie Lottery on\nthe first floor of the Radio\fTower yet?\rYou get more chances the more\nyou trade with different homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, last night...\rI was so stressed from work, I ate\na TON of junk food!\rMe and Mary got this deal about losin’\nweight... This ain’t it...\rHuh? What’s her weight?\nThat’s a TOTAL secret!\rMary weigh...\rAiyee! M-Mary!\rUh... Um... I... Wrong number!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesterday, Professor Oak was in the\nstudio to tape his show.\rSo I went and introduced myself.\nGet this--he listen to MY show!\rI hope he in again tomorrow!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Cough, cough!\nUhm sorry uh got uh code dite now.\rBuh uma pro so uh hav to cover id ub\nso no un notice while uhm on air.\rUh fidz muh voice now.\rCatch you on the fly. This been\nBuena!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo.\nYou won that Radio Card by passin’\fthe quiz at the front desk, right?\rGuess what? I wrote the questions!\n...They was too easy for you?\rWell, let’s chat again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m hype more people gettin’\ninto my password show.\rBut when PIKACHU was the password,\nit was uh...whew...a LOT.\rFan Club people came out in droves,\nscreamin’ “PIKACHU!” over and over.\rI mean, they was LOUD.\rAnybody tuned in around then musta\nbeen shook by the noise!\rAnyway, back to work for me!\nLet’s chat again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Guess what? The Radio Tower Director\nis a BIG TV fan!\rA while back, a fashion show on TV\nsaid brown suits was in.\rNow ALL he wear is brown suits.\rBut it’s a secret the Director a\nTV fan, so if you see him, don’t you\fDARE say nothin’!\rOh! The Director comin’!\nLater! Tune into my show!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Now, tell me.\rWhen you most relaxed? For me, it\ngotta be in the studio right after my\fshow, sippin’ a nice cup of tea.\rIt’s so nice it slowly\nmake me sleepy...\r...... ...... ......\r...... ...... ......Zzz\rOops, I dozed off just thinkin’ about\nit! How, uh...embarrassin’!\rForget that happened! Later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tell me, what was the first\nhomie you ever caught?\r...Oh, word?\rI seen lotsa homies around, but\nI never caught one.\rI should try sometime.\rYou know the first homie Mary\ncaught was a DROWZEE?\fThat’s SO not her!\rBut Mary’s DROWZEE kept puttin’ her\nto sleep on the job, so she traded a\ffan for a MEOWTH.\rLet’s chat about homies again!\nBye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...? Ben talked to the radio\nstaff on the phone for HOURS\fabout what homie music to\fplay on different days of the week.\rBy the end, Ben’s taste\nkinda got forced\fon ’em.\rThey ended up puttin’ up with Ben\nbein’ extra for a while.\rThey said they kinda\nenjoyed it though!\fLet’s chat again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m goin’ shoppin’ with Mary soon.\nIt’d be fire if the Goldenrod\fDept. Store got a sale when we go...\rSay, maybe we can go together too!\nCatch you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Guess what? Everybody at the Radio\nTower goin’ on a company trip\fto the Radio Tower in Lavender.\rWe wastin’ our vacation on a trip to\nANOTHER Radio Tower?\rI’d WAY rather hit the beach!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I hope you have enough\nfun for both of us on your journey!\rBye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Guess what? Everybody at the Radio\nTower goin’ on a company trip\fto the Radio Tower in Lavender.\rWe wastin’ our vacation on a trip to\nANOTHER Radio Tower?\rI’d WAY rather hit the beach!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I hope you have enough\nfun for both of us on your journey!\rBye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0641_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, ain’t you hittin’ all kinda\nspots, helpin’ out Professor Elm?\rThat’s hard. Fr, I’m jealous.\rIf I ever got a vacation, I know I’d\njust travel all over the place\fhowever I want.\rOh no! Gotta get back to work!\nTalk to you later!</language>
	</row>
</body>
